{"mangaRefs":["file-1022-1026"],"locationRefs":[],"summary":{"en":"Conan tries to convince Sera that he is not Shinichi, but Sera does not believe him. She then asks Ran and Sonoko if there is any child that looked more mature around Conan, and they both mention Haibara. While playing games with the Detective Boys at Agasa Residence, Haibara tells Agasa that thirty years ago, her father worked as a member of Shirohato Pharmaceuticals R&D team. However, the company went bankrupt twenty-five years ago and her parents decided to open a small clinic. Meanwhile, after some investigation, Conan solves the case using Sonoko's voice.","zhHans":"","zhHant":"","sourcePage":"Makoto_Kyogoku_the_Understudy","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-mary-sera","character-masumi-sera","character-ai-haibara","character-ran-mouri","character-conan-edogawa","character-shinichi-kudo","character-renya-karasuma","character-hiroshi-agasa","character-juzo-megure","character-makoto-kyogoku","character-elena-miyano","character-sonoko-suzuki","character-wataru-takagi","character-yukiko-kudo","character-atsushi-miyano","character-tomomi-sakaguchi"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":[],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"Vol. 96~97","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":994,"dcwMangaSource":"V96 - F8 ~ V97 - F1(1022-1026)","dcwMangaKind":"manga","dcwAirDate":"January 23, 2021"},"season":26,"solvedByRaw":"Sonoko Suzuki (via Conan)","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Ran Mouri","Masumi Sera","Sonoko Suzuki","Makoto Kyogoku","Juzo Megure","Wataru Takagi","Ai Haibara","Hiroshi Agasa","Detective Boys","Shinichi Kudo","Mary Sera","Atsushi Miyano","Elena Miyano","Renya Karasuma","Yukiko Kudo","Kamen Yaiba","Gomera","Tomomi Sakaguchi"],"dcwL3Source":{"season":"Makoto_Kyogoku_the_Understudy","characters":"Makoto_Kyogoku_the